{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M6Uytkb6mwHTxT6yEhRBJG","type":"tool_result","content":"41\t  rodata, base64 in a jar constant pool (Java/Kotlin, D24 Scala `$` module, D25 Clojure `<ns>__init.class` `encoded-config` Var)\n42\t  / Swift/Nim/D/Crystal literal, RAW FPC `.data`, WASM data seg 0, Ada/Fortran `.rodata`, D19 packed overlay, D20 RS20 overlay,\n43\t  D21 OCaml plugin `.data`, D22 F# RAW twice (`.text` + PE overlay: \"FIRST record that validates\"), D23 VB.NET RAW PE overlay.\n44\t  Rule: scan for `HCFG` and `SENGR[A-Za-z0-9+/_-]*=*` (jars: every class's constant pool), accept only crc32(plain) match AND\n45\t  parsing JSON, keep scanning past failures (D9 Nim decoys); never a fixed offset or a fixed class. Storage never changed WITHIN a day (single/TT/all Mastery sets).\n46\t- **Overlay layout per day (D19 PK19, D20 RS20)** -- appended at `e_shoff + e_shnum*e_shentsize`, magic `<2 caps><day>`, header\n47\t  spelled by the QUESTION: PK19 `magic|ver|k1|k2|pad|u32le packed_len @8|sha256(unpacked) @12|packed @44`, unpack `ror8(b^k2,3)^k1`;\n48\t  RS20 `magic|ver @4|u32le resource_len @8|u16le scratch_len @12|sha256(scratch) @16|HCFG @48 raw|scratch`. Rule: `o =\n49\t  data.rfind(magic)` (\"final\"), parse the listed widths, verify bounds + hash; unspecified transform -> known-plaintext `HCFG`.\n50\t- **Location / storage as answer** -- `hcfg_offset` = decimal FILE offset (base64 -> the `S`, RAW -> the `H`); `overlay_offset` =\n51\t  the magic, `overlay_size` = len - offset; `hcfg_resource_size` = the u32le @+8 (380). `hcfg_storage` (D17 enum) in order:\n52\t  `base64` -> `raw_hcfg_section` -> `wasm_data_segment` -> `raw_const_array` (other native data section) -> `raw`.\n53\t- **Any other encoding -> `lib.binary.hcfg_scan(data)`** (hex/base32/85/UTF-16/reversed/xor/zlib/multibyte+rolling xor/byte maps/\n54\t  custom b64/split/int-array/strided/RC4/AES/TEA/ChaCha/stack-built); `hcfg_find` = first valid hit. Not the PK19 